    "reviews_xJVeCd": {
      "type": "reviews",
      "blocks": {
        "review_VTQCTX": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "review_photo": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_5387.jpg",
            "review_name": "Yanina Sokolova",
            "review_about": "Ukrainian journalist, activist, blogger and actress. A volunteer with the Joint Forces Operation, media ambassador for the HeForShe women's rights movement in Ukraine, and founder of the \"Varto Zhyty\" (\"Worth Living\") foundation and the \"Ya, Nina\" (\"I, Nina\") project supporting people with cancer.",
            "review_text": "Ukrainian neurocosmetics are simply WOW! I've been using Re[Sens] for six months, and it's probably the best thing that's happened to me in a long time. Starting with the packaging — it's made from natural materials, mycelium, which biodegrades and doesn't pollute the environment. It's remarkable that in the middle of a war, Ukrainians are not only creating cosmetics but also thinking about the future of the planet.I have very sensitive skin with rosacea, so it matters to me that my skincare genuinely works. I'd especially like to mention the Hydroceramide Cream — a wonderful cream I use at night, after which my skin looks fuller and more radiant, and fine expression lines become less noticeable. I love this cream — it seems to sink right into the skin, giving that feeling of proper professional care.For sensitive skin I'd also recommend the A-Redensity Matt Cream — it works beautifully on redness. And a special love of mine — the 3Action Exosome Boost Eye Cream for the eye area.Support Ukrainian brands. Buy Re[Sens]."
          }
        },
        "review_LYg83X": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "review_photo": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_5062.jpg",
            "review_name": "Alina Onopa",
            "review_about": "TSN journalist",
            "review_text": "I really like the 3Action Exosome Boost Eye Cream; it has a great texture, moisturizes beautifully, and truly makes me look fresher and reduces puffiness after application. It’s an amazing product, especially after nights without enough sleep. Thank you so much! 🤍"
          }
        },
        "review_bmjYpd": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "review_photo": "shopify://shop_images/ziablova_olena.png",
            "review_name": "Zyablova Olena",
            "review_about": "Relax cosmetologist, owner of the beauty bar •cocoon",
            "review_text": "My clients are delighted with Re[Sens]. Textures, aromas, unusual packaging - the first thing that catches the eye. And then - the philosophy of slow beauty, the cumulative effect for the skin, love for nature! It all inspires and makes you fall in love! I am proud that we have such a brand, originally from Ukraine! ♥️"
          }
        },
        "review_UJXrJj": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "review_photo": "shopify://shop_images/bila_zhanna.png",
            "review_name": "Zhanna Bila",
            "review_about": "Cosmetologist-aesthetician, owner of the online store misocosmetics.com.ua",
            "review_text": "Re[Sens] is a brand that pleasantly surprises with its quality and well-thought-out formulas that really work. Its products have pleasant textures and give a tangible effect from the first applications. This is modern Ukrainian cosmetics, absolutely unique, which our customers trust and return for again and again."
          }
        },
        "review_6YgrpD": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "review_photo": "shopify://shop_images/3R2A0017.jpg",
            "review_name": "ANNA ZAVALSKA:",
            "review_about": "Singer, songwriter, translator of song lyrics, poetess",
            "review_text": "\"I’m proud to be among the first to try the line of new smart cosmetics with a Ukrainian identity—it’s love at first touch, a delight in textures, aroma, format, and form.I adore conceptual approaches, and in this case, I am thrilled by a brand that globally aims to care for you = nature, with absolutely no negative impact.\""
          }
        },
        "review_WqjhUV": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "review_photo": "shopify://shop_images/3R2A9753.jpg",
            "review_name": "OKSANA SHAVARSKA:",
            "review_about": "Writer, screenwriter, blogger",
            "review_text": "\"I love this cosmetics so much that it travels with me everywhere. My favorite product is the mattifying cream for sensitive skin. And the hyaluronic acid gommage mask—absolutely essential. It’s a miracle, not just a mask. I can’t express how happy I am to have this skincare routine.\""
          }
        },
        "review_ihwrhy": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "review_photo": "shopify://shop_images/3R2A1125.jpg",
            "review_name": "MARIANA HOLOVKO:",
            "review_about": "Singer, actress, soloist of Nova Opera, Suok Music, and Das Wortspiel projects",
            "review_text": "\"Re[Sens] cosmetics—highly biotechnological professional cosmetics created with love for women and their sensitivity in everything... skin sensitivity, environmental awareness (the packaging is compostable and harmless to the planet). This is a Ukrainian brand founded by people who are beautiful inside and out. I wholeheartedly recommend it. Thank you for giving me the joy of experiencing real care.\""
          }
        },
        "review_UrPGMn": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "review_photo": "shopify://shop_images/dsc08899.jpg",
            "review_name": "INESSA KRAVCHENKO:",
            "review_about": "Publisher of \"The Wheel of Life\" magazine",
            "review_text": "\"Wonderful cleansing products. No exaggeration. I bought them all! 😊 I use them as instructed and am genuinely impressed with the results. The serum and cream are just calling to be applied. Excellent quality care!\""
          }
        },
        "review_BVyjn3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "review_photo": "shopify://shop_images/3R2A0575.jpg",
            "review_name": "LALA TARAPAKINA:",
            "review_about": "Founder and activist of the “12 Guardians” charity fund",
            "review_text": "\"This business has been supporting my fund systematically for a long time, and I deeply value that they support the fund, not me personally. I felt the need to reciprocate and sincerely try for myself what has been crafted for three years with attention to every detail: the content—magical and scientific at the same time, the packaging—biodegradable, and the brand philosophy—allowing yourself to be sensual and sensitive.\""
          }
        }
      },
